# DentalVoice v4.0.0 Settings - Production-Grade Receptionist Dashboard

## DESIGN SYSTEM
Design accent color: #f43e01 (--color-accent). Used on primary CTA buttons and active nav states. Hover: #d63500.

## VERSION 4.1.1 MAJOR CHANGES
**api/lib/whatsapp.ts build errors fixed on 2025-05-09** — exactOptionalPropertyTypes violations resolved with nullish coalescing (`?? ''`) and type assertion patterns (`undefined as unknown as Type`) for clearing optional fields. Unused variable warnings addressed with underscore prefix. Module resolution fixed by moving `nextFiveWorkingDayOptions` import from `shared.js` to `booking.js` and adding `.js` extensions to dayjs plugin imports.

## VERSION 3.7.1 MAJOR CHANGES
**Settings UI Fixes**: Fixed Widget Embeddabil card rendering outside tab conditionals in SettingsSection.tsx. Replaced alert() calls with inline status state feedback for reminder save operations. Added working hours-aware reminder send time descriptions.

## VERSION 4.2.0 MAJOR CHANGES (Faza 2B - WhatsApp Twilio Migration)
**WhatsApp fully migrated to Twilio**: Replaced Meta Graph API with Twilio WhatsApp for all WhatsApp messaging
**verifyTwilioSignature replaces verifyWhatsAppSignature**: Webhook signature verification now uses TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN + X-Twilio-Signature header instead of Meta X-Hub-Signature-256
**Webhook POST supports dual format**: Twilio real format (From/Body urlencoded) + simulator JSON format (from/text/reset) for backward compatibility with WhatsappTest.tsx
**sendWhatsAppMessage() real implementation**: Added to api/lib/notifications.ts using TWILIO_WHATSAPP_NUMBER env var (sandbox: whatsapp:+14155238886, production: whatsapp:+40XXXXXXXXX)
**Sandbox→Production migration**: Only change TWILIO_WHATSAPP_NUMBER env var, zero code change required
**WhatsApp reminders real**: /api/cron/reminders route now uses sendWhatsAppMessage() for real outbound WhatsApp messages
**WhatsappTest.tsx simulator preserved**: Backward compatible JSON format maintained for testing
**GET webhook simplified**: Replaced Meta hub challenge verification with simple health check (Twilio does not require GET challenge)
**Urlencoded body parsing**: Added express.urlencoded({ extended: false }) middleware for /api/webhook/whatsapp route to handle Twilio's application/x-www-form-urlencoded format
**Removed Meta dependencies**: WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET, META_WEBHOOK_VERIFY_TOKEN no longer used in code (removed from api/index.ts)

## VERSION 4.1.0 MAJOR CHANGES
**JWT Authentication Migration**: Replaced VITE_ADMIN_API_KEY frontend secret with Supabase JWT authentication for all dashboard API calls
**Backend Security**: Added verifySupabaseJWT middleware in api/index.ts to validate Supabase JWT tokens using supabaseAdmin.auth.getUser(token)
**Frontend Security**: Added getAuthHeaders() helper function in ClinicDashboard.tsx, SettingsSection.tsx, and EditBlockedSlotModal.tsx to use Supabase session tokens
**Route Protection**: Replaced protectRoute middleware with verifySupabaseJWT on all admin routes (/api/config, /api/doctors, /api/services, /api/holidays, /api/calendar/*, /api/bookings, /api/delete-booking, /api/temp-reservation)
**Secret Removal**: VITE_ADMIN_API_KEY removed from frontend - ADMIN_API_KEY remains server-only for internal/legacy use
**Authentication Flow**: Dashboard users must authenticate via Supabase Auth; JWT tokens automatically managed by Supabase client with auto-refresh

## VERSION 4.0.0 MAJOR CHANGES
**Embeddable Widget**: public/widget.js (vanilla JS, IIFE, no build step) served from /widget.js with CORS headers. Clinics embed via single <script> tag with data-color and data-button-text attributes.
**Embed Route**: /embed/chat route → EmbedChatPage.tsx renders ChatWidget with isOpen=true, onClose=no-op, embedded=true. No auth guard. No navigation wrapper.
**ChatWidget embedded prop**: Added embedded?: boolean prop. When true: layout switches to absolute inset-0 (fills iframe), X close button hidden.
**iframe lazy load**: widget.js sets iframe.src only on first button click, never on page load.
**vercel.json**: /widget.js → Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *; /embed/ → frame-ancestors: *.
**SettingsSection Widget Snippet**: "Widget Embeddabil" card with one-click copy of ready-to-use <script> snippet.
**Single-tenant embed**: each clinic deployment serves its own widget.js pointing to its own /embed/chat. No backend routing changes needed.

## VERSION 3.9.0 MAJOR CHANGES
**Comprehensive Parameterization**: All magic numbers and hardcoded values moved to environment variables for SaaS scalability. CLINIC_TIMEZONE, MIN_LEAD_TIME_HOURS, OTP_EXPIRY_MINUTES, OTP_CODE_LENGTH, SLOT_BUFFER_TODAY_MINUTES, NEXT_WORKING_DAYS_COUNT, MAX_DAY_SEARCH, DOCTOR_CACHE_TTL_MS, REMINDER_END_BUFFER_MINUTES, CRON_WINDOW_MINUTES, PENDING_STALE_MINUTES, WHATSAPP_GREETING_TEXT now configurable per deployment.
**Unified Config API**: Added async getConfig() in api/lib/shared.ts that merges env vars + DB config into single source of truth for use in async contexts.
**Dynamic OTP System**: OTP code generation and expiry now parameterized via OTP_CODE_LENGTH (default 4 digits) and OTP_EXPIRY_MINUTES (default 10).
**Flexible Scheduling**: Lead time, slot buffer, working days count, and search window all configurable via environment variables.
**Reminder System Parameterization**: Reminder end buffer and cron processing window now configurable for different clinic workflows.

## VERSION 3.8.0 MAJOR CHANGES
**Multi-tenant Database Layer**: Added clinic_id to unlocked_slots and temp_reservations tables for proper multi-tenancy. Created clinic_users mapping table (auth user → clinic_id) for future per-clinic auth. Applied deny-all RLS policies on all 10 tables for defense-in-depth security.
**Dynamic clinic_id**: Replaced all hardcoded 'beautiful-smile-demo' with getClinicId() from api/lib/shared.ts. CLINIC_ID env var controls which clinic a deployment serves (Vercel env per tenant).

## VERSION 3.7.0 MAJOR CHANGES
**SMS Reminder System**: calculateReminderSendTime() enforces working hours constraint — reminders shift to previous working day end if ideal time falls outside clinic hours. sendSmsReminder() abstraction in shared.ts ready for Twilio/Vonage integration. Reminder config UI in Services tab.
**Working Hours Intelligence**: Smart reminder scheduling respects clinic working hours and working days, automatically adjusts send times to avoid after-hours notifications
**Enhanced Database Schema**: Added reminder_enabled, reminder_channel, reminder_lead_hours, reminder_message_template, reminder_custom_hours columns to clinic_config table
**Improved Cron Processing**: Rewritten /api/cron/reminders endpoint with 60-minute window processing and enhanced error handling
**Modern Settings UI**: Clean reminder configuration interface in Services tab with toggle, radio buttons, template editor, and live preview
**Template System**: Variable-based message templates with {{PATIENT_NAME}}, {{APPOINTMENT_DATE}}, {{APPOINTMENT_TIME}}, {{DOCTOR_NAME}}, {{CLINIC_NAME}}, {{CLINIC_PHONE}}, {{CLINIC_ADDRESS}} placeholders

